WEBVTT

01:31.136 --> 01:34.024
[Episode 23]

02:32.520 --> 02:34.599
When you become a poison person

02:34.599 --> 02:37.500
and harm the people of the capital
along with them.

02:46.800 --> 02:48.300
Hold on to me.

02:51.080 --> 02:55.180
Meng Ting Hui, stay awake. Stay awake.

03:04.159 --> 03:07.539
Your Majesty! Hold on!

03:21.879 --> 03:23.379
Huang Bo!

03:29.759 --> 03:31.439
Your Majesty,

03:31.439 --> 03:37.539
I can no longer protect you.

03:38.360 --> 03:39.860
Huang Bo!

03:40.840 --> 03:42.340
Huang Bo!

04:18.639 --> 04:20.480
Meng Ting Hui?

04:20.480 --> 04:23.439
Hold on. Meng Ting Hui!

04:23.439 --> 04:27.540
Master, the Divine Guard has surrounded us.
We must retreat now.

04:41.279 --> 04:42.939
Master!

04:46.600 --> 04:48.220
Master!

05:31.199 --> 05:33.040
Search thoroughly.

05:33.040 --> 05:35.460
I want to see him, alive or dead!

05:35.460 --> 05:37.030
Yes!

05:48.639 --> 05:50.139
Lord Di.

05:59.360 --> 06:00.360
Search carefully.

06:00.360 --> 06:01.860
Yes!

06:11.839 --> 06:13.339
There is a bloodstain here.

06:30.439 --> 06:32.120
Who are you?

06:32.120 --> 06:33.980
Why do you want to kill me?

06:37.920 --> 06:39.699
There's something over there!

06:46.959 --> 06:48.459
Hurry!

06:59.480 --> 07:02.300
He's still breathing. Take him away.

08:16.240 --> 08:18.300
It's been three days.

08:19.180 --> 08:21.279
Why hasn't she woken up yet?

08:21.279 --> 08:22.830
Your Majesty,

08:22.830 --> 08:25.439
Miss Meng's arrow wound is life-threatening.

08:25.439 --> 08:27.480
Fortunately, it missed her heart
by a coin's width.

08:27.480 --> 08:30.360
It is a blessing from heaven
that she survived.

08:30.360 --> 08:31.519
To recover,

08:31.519 --> 08:33.960
it will still take some time.

08:33.960 --> 08:35.559
Is her condition

08:35.559 --> 08:38.320
related to consuming too many Eternity Pills?

08:38.320 --> 08:41.879
Your Majesty,
I have been treating Miss Meng for days.

08:41.879 --> 08:45.799
I haven't found any residue
of Eternity Pills in her body.

08:45.799 --> 08:49.399
Miss Meng's symptoms
were completely different from Miss Yan's.

08:49.399 --> 08:52.779
It was actually
because of the severe sword wound.

09:00.679 --> 09:03.120
No matter what rare herbs

09:03.120 --> 09:05.320
or treatment methods it takes,

09:05.320 --> 09:07.720
you must cure Miss Meng as soon as possible.

09:07.720 --> 09:11.539
I want her to be safe and sound.

09:12.350 --> 09:15.220
I will do my utmost.

09:39.770 --> 09:41.290
Huang Bo.

09:48.200 --> 09:49.700
Someone.

09:50.830 --> 09:53.679
- Your Majesty?
- Any news on Imperial Guard Huang yet?

09:53.679 --> 09:56.779
Captain Di and his men
are searching at full strength.

10:06.840 --> 10:08.340
Zhi Shu.

10:09.759 --> 10:12.960
I got Meng all the things
she normally uses and eats.

10:12.960 --> 10:14.860
But she hasn't woken up yet.

10:15.679 --> 10:19.840
Back when I was poisoned,
was she suffering like this as well?

10:19.840 --> 10:22.320
She stayed by my side all night.

10:22.320 --> 10:24.259
Now it's my turn.

10:24.870 --> 10:27.279
I'm so scared.

10:27.279 --> 10:29.899
I'm really scared.

10:31.840 --> 10:34.399
Miss Meng has weathered many storms.

10:34.399 --> 10:36.460
She will surely be fine this time.

10:43.679 --> 10:46.200
After all these hardships,

10:46.200 --> 10:48.840
I realize
I should cherish the one by my side.

10:48.840 --> 10:50.399
You must take care of yourself.

10:50.399 --> 10:51.980
Don't exhaust yourself.

10:56.864 --> 10:59.740
[Gu Mansion]

10:59.740 --> 11:01.299
He is dead.

11:06.430 --> 11:08.240
Master.

11:08.240 --> 11:09.720
Don't you know to knock first?

11:09.720 --> 11:11.799
I saw you communicating with Beijian people.

11:11.799 --> 11:13.919
Are you proposing the Beijian goddess
for the marriage alliance?

11:13.919 --> 11:15.320
You went through my study again?

11:15.320 --> 11:16.820
Does that matter?

11:18.360 --> 11:20.360
I came today to remind you

11:20.360 --> 11:22.600
that the Beijian goddess is a foreign woman.

11:22.600 --> 11:24.200
Even if she truly becomes the Empress,

11:24.200 --> 11:26.200
why would she ever truly answer to you?

11:26.200 --> 11:28.559
If you want
to control the position of the Empress,

11:28.559 --> 11:30.980
Shen Zhi Li is the most fitting choice.

11:33.840 --> 11:36.860
A woman should not speak lightly
of state matters.

11:37.680 --> 11:40.120
Don't you
dream of climbing to a high position?

11:40.120 --> 11:42.310
Why put on this act of being above it all?

11:42.310 --> 11:45.320
The credit for water control back then
was originally my father's.

11:45.320 --> 11:47.060
If he hadn't drowned,

11:47.060 --> 11:50.080
would you have ever become
Ning Empire's youngest chancellor?

11:50.080 --> 11:53.120
All these years, I have never exposed you.

11:53.120 --> 11:55.279
Now I am even planning for you.

11:55.279 --> 11:57.360
You can even use my Yuan family.

11:57.360 --> 11:59.279
Why can't you use Shen Zhi Li?

11:59.279 --> 12:01.820
You sure know how to rake up the past.

12:02.960 --> 12:04.759
The Empress's position
concerns the state's fate.

12:04.759 --> 12:06.700
It is not for you to interfere.

12:07.600 --> 12:09.360
I'll ask you one thing today.

12:09.360 --> 12:10.919
You refused to recommend Shen Zhi Li.

12:10.919 --> 12:12.919
Is it for yourself or not?

12:12.919 --> 12:14.470
Ridiculous!

12:14.470 --> 12:16.620
State business calls.
No time for your nonsense.

12:19.639 --> 12:20.840
What is this?

12:20.840 --> 12:22.440
Look at you, Gu Qin.

12:22.440 --> 12:24.559
Before I came today, I kept convincing myself

12:24.559 --> 12:26.919
that if you were willing
to recommend Shen Zhi Li as Empress,

12:26.919 --> 12:29.279
I would turn a blind eye
to all your filthy deeds.

12:29.279 --> 12:31.000
But you simply can't bear to let her go.

12:31.000 --> 12:33.620
You want to keep her for yourself, don't you?

12:34.710 --> 12:38.200
These are just portraits
for teaching purposes.

12:38.200 --> 12:41.360
You are still hiding them?

12:41.360 --> 12:43.000
Don't you know exactly what filthy thoughts

12:43.000 --> 12:44.440
were running through your mind

12:44.440 --> 12:45.720
when you painted these portraits?

12:45.720 --> 12:48.500
Have you forgotten those paintings
you gave me back then?

12:51.799 --> 12:52.799
Ling Yi,

12:52.799 --> 12:55.399
recommending the Beijian goddess
is all about diplomacy.

12:55.399 --> 12:57.039
His Majesty will definitely not refuse.

12:57.039 --> 12:59.159
The goddess will have no support
in the Ning Empire.

12:59.159 --> 13:01.000
If I can help her become the Empress,

13:01.000 --> 13:03.720
she will inevitably rely on me.

13:03.720 --> 13:06.039
Ling Yi, we are a couple.

13:06.039 --> 13:08.179
You should see the bigger picture.

13:16.980 --> 13:19.320
You still know that I am your wife?

13:19.320 --> 13:22.730
You used the entire Yuan family
as a stepping stone for your career.

13:22.730 --> 13:24.030
Now that my father is gone,

13:24.030 --> 13:27.220
you can't even be bothered
to pretend to love me anymore.

13:35.519 --> 13:37.019
Ling Yi,

13:37.720 --> 13:40.559
state affairs keep me busy.
So I've been neglecting you.

13:40.559 --> 13:42.360
We've been married for ten years.

13:42.360 --> 13:44.860
You're not the same person
you used to be either.

13:45.480 --> 13:46.780
We are both at this age.

13:46.780 --> 13:49.700
Stop being aggressive
and arguing endlessly, alright?

13:49.700 --> 13:52.039
Yes, I have changed.

13:52.039 --> 13:55.740
I have become a shrewish woman
all because you forced me to.

13:56.440 --> 13:58.440
Gu Qin,

13:58.440 --> 14:00.840
you've shunned me and wronged me.

14:00.840 --> 14:04.399
You've trapped me in this mansion,
making me suffer a lot.

14:04.399 --> 14:07.000
Now you are getting warm
with Shen Zhi Li, aren't you?

14:07.000 --> 14:10.639
You once charmed me
with verses, paintings, and music,

14:10.639 --> 14:13.840
and now you're using them all on her.

14:13.840 --> 14:16.320
You know what?
I'm going to tell the entire court

14:16.320 --> 14:18.150
how you, the dignified Right Chancellor,

14:18.150 --> 14:21.000
- teach your prized student!
- Shut up!

14:21.000 --> 14:22.240
Shut up now!

14:22.240 --> 14:23.720
For ten years,

14:23.720 --> 14:25.879
you've been watching me with suspicion.

14:25.879 --> 14:29.470
You drag up every petty thing against me.

14:29.470 --> 14:32.360
Nothing I do ever satisfies you.

14:32.360 --> 14:34.480
Since you regret marrying me,

14:34.480 --> 14:36.299
let's dissolve our marriage.

14:42.630 --> 14:45.440
You finally spoke your true feelings,
didn't you?

14:45.440 --> 14:49.759
Is it because my Yuan family
is now useless to you,

14:49.759 --> 14:52.879
and I am old and faded,
not as charming as Shen Zhi Li?

14:52.879 --> 14:55.840
The Shen family
is powerful and prosperous now.

14:55.840 --> 14:58.659
You want to abandon me
and cling to them, don't you?

15:00.120 --> 15:02.200
You are simply unreasonable.

15:02.200 --> 15:03.840
You act

15:03.840 --> 15:07.040
as if you're the noblest lady,
looking down on all.

15:07.040 --> 15:09.360
You fly into a rage
at the slightest dissatisfaction.

15:09.360 --> 15:12.039
I never expected you to be a virtuous wife.

15:12.039 --> 15:15.000
But you've never borne a child,
leaving me no heir to carry on my line.

15:15.000 --> 15:17.240
And you spend all day
on those supernatural things,

15:17.240 --> 15:19.720
making me the laughingstock of the court,
and lose face.

15:19.720 --> 15:21.659
Is it my fault?

15:23.279 --> 15:25.350
It's you

15:26.100 --> 15:28.159
who never comes to my room at night

15:28.159 --> 15:29.759
and finds all excuses to avoid it.

15:29.759 --> 15:31.980
Now you blame me instead?

15:33.399 --> 15:35.450
Gu Qin,

15:35.450 --> 15:38.120
you are truly an extremely selfish person.

15:38.120 --> 15:40.879
Your affection for Shen Zhi Li is also fake.

15:40.879 --> 15:43.039
You have only ever loved yourself.

15:43.039 --> 15:44.720
You're nothing but a hypocrite

15:44.720 --> 15:46.740
who climbed to a high position
by using women!

15:57.240 --> 15:58.759
You hit me?

15:58.759 --> 16:00.820
You laid a hand on me?

16:07.480 --> 16:09.179
Gu Qin, listen to me.

16:10.519 --> 16:13.220
As long as I live one day,

16:13.970 --> 16:16.740
I will never give my place to Shen Zhi Li.

16:44.000 --> 16:47.480
Your Majesty, the court cannot go
a single day without its ruler.

16:47.480 --> 16:49.720
You haven't attended the court for days.

16:49.720 --> 16:51.480
State affairs are piling up.

16:51.480 --> 16:52.980
Moreover,

16:53.759 --> 16:57.759
Your Majesty has been
by Miss Meng's side for days.

16:57.759 --> 17:01.879
This is truly against propriety.

17:01.879 --> 17:04.599
Miss Meng investigated the Huxiao Gang
thoroughly

17:04.599 --> 17:07.200
and even took an arrow for me.

17:07.200 --> 17:11.559
Am I now being criticized
for visiting a loyal subject?

17:11.559 --> 17:12.960
I deserve death ten thousand times.

17:12.960 --> 17:15.440
Miss Meng's merits
are witnessed by heaven and earth.

17:15.440 --> 17:18.359
Your Majesty has been here
for several nights.

17:18.359 --> 17:21.880
I am truly worried about your health.

17:21.880 --> 17:25.839
I beg you to return to the palace
and rest for now.

17:25.839 --> 17:28.039
It will not be too late to wait

17:28.039 --> 17:31.259
until Miss Meng recovers and visit her then.

17:36.160 --> 17:39.359
Your Majesty, Chief Steward You,
please return to the palace now.

17:39.359 --> 17:41.400
I will stay here and take good care of Meng.

17:41.400 --> 17:44.960
Your Majesty, I won't let Miss Meng
come to any harm.

17:44.960 --> 17:47.099
If Miss Meng has any change,

17:48.200 --> 17:49.720
report immediately.

17:49.720 --> 17:51.220
Yes.

17:57.960 --> 17:59.599
Ms. Yan,

17:59.599 --> 18:02.599
I suddenly remembered
that when I was developing the antidote,

18:02.599 --> 18:05.160
I stored a box of storax at Bofeng House.

18:05.160 --> 18:07.200
It revives the mind.

18:07.200 --> 18:09.059
It might help Miss Meng.

18:10.200 --> 18:12.779
Really? Then I'll go right away.

19:13.559 --> 19:15.059
You finally woke up.

19:19.960 --> 19:22.960
I had

19:22.960 --> 19:25.059
a very scary

19:26.119 --> 19:28.420
and very strange dream.

19:42.210 --> 19:43.940
Come in.

19:43.940 --> 19:45.460
Fu Zhi?

19:47.960 --> 19:49.619
Untie your outer robe.

19:50.799 --> 19:53.640
Well, in broad daylight,

19:53.640 --> 19:57.039
I'm a bit embarrassed by you being so eager.

19:57.039 --> 19:59.859
Shen Zhi Shu, stop acting.

20:01.200 --> 20:02.700
Let me check out.

20:18.359 --> 20:20.440
Fu Zhi,

20:20.440 --> 20:22.200
I'm sorry.

20:22.200 --> 20:23.819
I made you sad again.

20:29.440 --> 20:31.099
It was my fault.

20:32.079 --> 20:33.779
I was too careless.

20:34.440 --> 20:36.740
I didn't know you were injured so badly.

20:40.279 --> 20:43.720
A man needs a few scars on his body,

20:43.720 --> 20:45.640
and that's what proves his courage.

20:45.640 --> 20:47.599
Shen Zhi Shu,

20:47.599 --> 20:48.799
listen carefully.

20:48.799 --> 20:51.519
Your body is not yours alone.

20:51.519 --> 20:55.240
Since you came back from Shazhou,
it also belongs to me.

20:55.240 --> 20:56.740
Next time,

20:57.519 --> 21:00.000
if you dare not take it seriously,

21:00.000 --> 21:02.960
let it be in danger, or let it bleed,

21:02.960 --> 21:04.980
I will absolutely not forgive you.

21:06.720 --> 21:08.220
I was wrong.

21:15.559 --> 21:17.980
If you dare to get hurt like this again,

21:18.960 --> 21:21.839
I will find several handsome young men

21:21.839 --> 21:23.160
to drive you crazy.

21:23.160 --> 21:24.559
I won't dare.

21:24.559 --> 21:27.119
My lady's command
is weightier than Mount Tai.

21:27.119 --> 21:30.380
Who is your lady? We haven't married yet.

21:34.559 --> 21:36.099
You will be soon.

21:37.920 --> 21:40.948
[Gu Mansion]

21:58.880 --> 22:00.940
Why did you kill Master?

22:01.559 --> 22:03.059
Lv Da?

22:04.640 --> 22:06.140
You are still alive?

22:07.400 --> 22:09.220
Surprised, aren't you?

22:17.920 --> 22:19.079
You are injured?

22:19.079 --> 22:20.609
I have good medicine for wounds in my study.

22:20.609 --> 22:22.819
- Come with me--
- Stop your hypocrisy.

22:23.440 --> 22:26.059
I followed the assassin all the way here.

22:27.279 --> 22:32.400
I didn't expect you to be so heartless
as Master's elder brother.

22:32.400 --> 22:34.759
I will kill you now

22:34.759 --> 22:38.000
so you can accompany Master
on the way to the underworld.

22:38.000 --> 22:40.440
Lv Da, I had no choice but to kill him.

22:40.440 --> 22:43.519
You saw it yourself. He was extremely insane.

22:43.519 --> 22:46.839
I have kept all the silver
he gave me over the years.

22:46.839 --> 22:48.640
It's enough for you
to rebuild the Huxiao Gang.

22:48.640 --> 22:50.680
You can be its new gang leader,

22:50.680 --> 22:52.000
and I will be your backer.

22:52.000 --> 22:56.460
Someday the capital's underground world
will all be yours to rule.

22:59.279 --> 23:04.000
You want me
to be your obedient dog, don't you?

23:04.000 --> 23:05.720
Even if he was insane,

23:05.720 --> 23:08.799
he was still your real brother!

23:08.799 --> 23:10.859
Now die!

23:14.119 --> 23:16.400
He brought it upon himself.

23:16.400 --> 23:20.640
I warned him long ago
not to touch the Eternity Pills.

23:20.640 --> 23:24.359
If he had restrained himself,
how could it have come to this?

23:24.359 --> 23:28.390
He ended up like this all because of you.

23:28.390 --> 23:31.119
You forced him down this path.

23:31.119 --> 23:33.900
He regarded you as his only family.

23:35.200 --> 23:37.680
Well, Lv Da,

23:37.680 --> 23:41.599
you are not related to him. Why go this far?

23:41.599 --> 23:43.359
Isn't being the new gang leader good?

23:43.359 --> 23:47.039
Twelve years ago, I was hunted by enemies.

23:47.039 --> 23:50.759
And he pulled me out from a pile of corpses.

23:50.759 --> 23:53.759
My life has long been his.

23:53.759 --> 23:57.160
You don't acknowledge him as a brother,

23:57.160 --> 23:58.700
but I do.

24:00.039 --> 24:02.359
He just valued bonds too much.

24:02.359 --> 24:06.019
That's why he was used by you time and again.

24:06.799 --> 24:08.660
My lady, slow down.

24:10.630 --> 24:13.240
My lady, you're having a strong reaction.

24:13.240 --> 24:15.680
I think it's about to rain.

24:15.680 --> 24:17.279
Why don't we go back to your room first?

24:17.279 --> 24:18.440
It's fine.

24:18.440 --> 24:21.279
I want to tell my husband
this good news myself.

24:21.279 --> 24:22.400
Dou Kou,

24:22.400 --> 24:24.720
go to the kitchen and get me some sour plums.

24:24.720 --> 24:26.220
I'll go right now.

24:33.279 --> 24:37.160
You used Master to kidnap Lady Yuan

24:37.160 --> 24:39.880
while you played the hero saving the beauty.

24:39.880 --> 24:42.200
After getting married,
to seize the chancellor position,

24:42.200 --> 24:44.980
you again used Master
to murder your father-in-law.

24:58.680 --> 24:59.759
Master.

24:59.759 --> 25:00.920
Ling Yi.

25:00.920 --> 25:02.500
What did you say?

25:03.240 --> 25:04.819
Say it again.

25:12.119 --> 25:13.960
Lady Yuan,

25:13.960 --> 25:16.240
you came at the right time.

25:16.240 --> 25:17.720
You probably don't know yet.

25:17.720 --> 25:18.799
Your husband

25:18.799 --> 25:21.680
had a half-brother from the same father.

25:21.680 --> 25:26.259
He had his brother kill your father.

25:27.960 --> 25:32.819
Yet he played the virtuous son-in-law
by your side for so many years.

25:46.519 --> 25:48.750
Ling Yi,

25:48.750 --> 25:50.859
what he said is false.

25:55.720 --> 25:59.140
For ten years, a full ten years,

26:00.120 --> 26:03.359
I have lived in your carefully crafted lies.

26:03.359 --> 26:05.119
Life-saving grace?

26:05.119 --> 26:06.720
Catering to my interests?

26:06.720 --> 26:08.680
All were calculations.

26:08.680 --> 26:10.279
When my father...

26:10.279 --> 26:12.920
When my father died that night,

26:12.920 --> 26:16.039
you held me and said
you'd take care of me for life,

26:16.039 --> 26:18.420
and even that was all fake too.

26:21.160 --> 26:22.779
Ling Yi,

26:23.839 --> 26:26.480
how can you believe the words of a madman?

26:26.480 --> 26:29.059
We are husband and wife.

26:32.279 --> 26:34.119
Using me was one thing,

26:34.119 --> 26:36.440
but why did you have to kill my father?

26:36.440 --> 26:37.940
Why?

26:39.160 --> 26:41.599
He treated you like his own son.

26:41.599 --> 26:44.359
Yet he died at the hands
of the one he trusted most.

26:44.359 --> 26:45.940
Why?

26:47.519 --> 26:51.720
Gu Qin, for ten years,
you've acted so well in front of me.

26:51.720 --> 26:54.599
You can shed tears at will.

26:54.599 --> 26:58.160
I have never truly understood you.

26:58.160 --> 26:59.480
To me,

26:59.480 --> 27:02.380
how many other filthy things have you done?

27:05.000 --> 27:06.850
Right.

27:06.850 --> 27:09.500
Are you planning to kill me now too?

27:15.720 --> 27:17.220
Right.

27:18.359 --> 27:19.859
Once I am dead,

27:22.799 --> 27:25.980
you can go to Shen Zhi Li justifiably.

27:27.599 --> 27:31.539
Ling Yi, my feelings for you are sincere.

27:33.039 --> 27:35.779
Everything he said was fabricated.

27:37.000 --> 27:39.539
You must believe me.

27:42.240 --> 27:44.180
Forget everything today.

27:45.039 --> 27:46.940
Let's live well together.

28:02.079 --> 28:04.640
Don't come closer! Stay back!

28:04.640 --> 28:07.200
You demon in human skin.

28:07.200 --> 28:09.119
Ling Yun Fei is now at the Censorate.

28:09.119 --> 28:12.559
I will go tell Meng Ting Hui
and Shen Zhi Li right now

28:12.559 --> 28:15.850
how you murdered your father-in-law
and deceived His Majesty.

28:15.850 --> 28:18.859
Today I will avenge my father!

28:49.440 --> 28:52.440
<i>I vow to sincerely worship Buddha from today,</i>

28:52.440 --> 28:55.640
<i>praying heaven
to bestow a son upon the Gu family</i>

28:55.640 --> 28:57.299
<i>to continue our family line.</i>

29:17.590 --> 29:20.539
Lord Gu indeed has a son in his fate.

29:21.440 --> 29:25.000
But that boy is not blessed.

29:25.000 --> 29:28.180
Master, we will surely have a child.

29:38.880 --> 29:40.890
I've finally...

29:40.890 --> 29:43.279
I've finally reached where I am now.

29:43.279 --> 29:45.320
Why can't you...

29:45.320 --> 29:47.539
Why can't you let me go?

29:48.240 --> 29:49.880
Master,

29:49.880 --> 29:52.140
the thing I regret the most

29:53.319 --> 29:56.180
is that back then under the peach tree,

29:57.640 --> 30:02.259
I mistook your false affection for true love.

30:11.160 --> 30:13.559
Only when I am with you

30:13.559 --> 30:15.619
can I truly be myself.

30:17.119 --> 30:19.059
I want to protect you for life.

30:21.160 --> 30:24.539
Would you be brave for me once?

31:05.519 --> 31:07.140
Someone!

31:07.839 --> 31:09.880
Assassin!

31:09.880 --> 31:12.720
My wife has been attacked!

31:12.720 --> 31:15.160
Assassin!

31:15.160 --> 31:17.400
My wife has been attacked!

31:17.400 --> 31:20.380
My wife has been attacked!

31:31.712 --> 31:33.556
[Censorate]

31:42.528 --> 31:43.708
[Why did the poison people attack Ying Gua?]

31:43.708 --> 31:44.839
[Who is backing the Huxiao Gang?]

31:44.839 --> 31:47.220
Yin Qing, the case files.

31:51.039 --> 31:52.539
Yin Qing.

31:58.599 --> 32:00.880
Ling Yun Fei is in the Censorate's prison.

32:00.880 --> 32:03.240
And villagers of the Wangxian Valley
are all settled.

32:03.240 --> 32:06.980
Your wound hasn't healed.
You should rest more.

32:17.599 --> 32:19.500
We've taken Ling Yun Fei,

32:20.119 --> 32:22.599
but I still have many questions.

32:22.599 --> 32:26.279
Why did I take the Eternity Pill
but not get poisoned?

32:26.279 --> 32:30.079
Besides Ling Yun Fei,
who else can control the poison people?

32:30.079 --> 32:32.279
And they avoided me
and targeted only Your Majesty.

32:32.279 --> 32:35.720
What is the connection
between those assassins and the Huxiao Gang?

32:35.720 --> 32:39.900
Imperial Physician Li examined
and found no residual poison in your body.

32:40.720 --> 32:42.960
Perhaps your constitution is special,

32:42.960 --> 32:45.640
resistant to the Fuqing herb.

32:45.640 --> 32:48.039
I mentioned Zhongwan to you before.

32:48.039 --> 32:50.880
Now it's time to tell you more.

32:50.880 --> 32:53.799
After Zhongwan was destroyed,
a remnant faction

32:53.799 --> 32:56.640
formed an organization
called the Blood Moon Society.

32:56.640 --> 32:58.200
They have been dormant for years,

32:58.200 --> 33:00.759
harboring the delusion
of restoring their nation.

33:00.759 --> 33:02.430
Did those assassins

33:02.430 --> 33:06.680
try to kill Your Majesty
for Blood Moon Society's cause?

33:06.680 --> 33:09.440
And that arrow.

33:09.440 --> 33:12.779
You should not have taken that arrow for me.

33:16.400 --> 33:18.839
You were unconscious for days.

33:18.839 --> 33:21.200
And Huang Bo was missing.

33:21.200 --> 33:22.819
I was very afraid...

33:24.599 --> 33:27.519
I was afraid that when I woke up,
I'd never see you--

33:27.519 --> 33:29.240
Your Majesty,

33:29.240 --> 33:32.339
Huang's remains have been found.

34:22.760 --> 34:26.639
Your Majesty, Huang's body
is severely damaged.

34:26.639 --> 34:28.380
It might shock Your Majesty.

35:01.159 --> 35:04.780
Huang's sword has also been found.

35:42.639 --> 35:44.460
From now on,

35:45.760 --> 35:47.860
inside and outside the palace walls,

35:49.000 --> 35:52.480
there will be no one
to accompany me like you did.

35:52.480 --> 35:56.400
Huang, weren't you always
the most rule-abiding?

35:56.400 --> 35:59.119
Showing up injured before His Majesty
is disrespectful.

35:59.119 --> 36:01.280
Get up quickly and apologize to His Majesty.

36:01.280 --> 36:02.780
Huang,

36:03.719 --> 36:05.599
rest in peace.

36:05.599 --> 36:07.099
From now on,

36:07.880 --> 36:10.199
we'll take care of His Majesty's safety.

36:10.199 --> 36:12.019
Just as you did before.

36:15.280 --> 36:17.340
Issue my decree.

36:18.400 --> 36:22.440
Posthumously bestow upon Huang Bo
the title of Divine Might General.

36:22.440 --> 36:23.920
Find a worthy burial site

36:23.920 --> 36:27.119
outside the West Mausoleum
and lay him to rest

36:27.119 --> 36:29.840
to honor his immortal merits.

36:29.840 --> 36:31.340
Yes!

38:04.760 --> 38:07.010
If a wound is always hidden,

38:07.690 --> 38:10.000
it becomes harder to heal.

38:10.000 --> 38:11.960
Pain is the same.

38:11.960 --> 38:15.559
The more you suppress it,
the more it eats at your bones.

38:15.559 --> 38:17.880
I understand Your Majesty's pain.

38:17.880 --> 38:20.059
Xiang died protecting me.

38:20.800 --> 38:24.000
Fu Zhi almost lost her life because of me.

38:24.000 --> 38:25.960
Such heart-wrenching pain

38:28.330 --> 38:30.300
makes life worse than death.

39:13.559 --> 39:15.820
A wound this small

39:15.820 --> 39:18.119
can even bleed so much.

39:18.119 --> 39:19.820
Let alone a wounded heart.

39:23.960 --> 39:25.700
Your Majesty,

39:25.700 --> 39:28.099
perhaps it would feel better to cry.

39:34.039 --> 39:36.179
My father taught me

39:37.199 --> 39:38.860
to abandon personal feelings

39:39.519 --> 39:41.390
to achieve great righteousness
since I was little.

39:41.390 --> 39:42.940
For twenty years,

39:43.730 --> 39:47.679
I have been learning
to be cold and unfeeling,

39:47.679 --> 39:49.219
without weakness.

39:52.150 --> 39:55.059
I've restrained
from getting too close to others

39:56.400 --> 40:00.380
and never expected others
to understand my loneliness

40:01.559 --> 40:04.340
or tied my emotions to others.

40:11.760 --> 40:13.940
But no matter how much I restrain myself,

40:19.320 --> 40:21.900
there will always be someone who makes me sad

40:23.360 --> 40:24.860
and wins my heart.
